  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.8.223",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.223\n\nReleased on 2026-10-31.\n\nReverse any video now runs on the HyperFrames plan, with clearer credit wording. Preview voice no longer drops out while other tracks play, and Windows renders keep their telemetry.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Skills:** Re-land reverse any video on the HyperFrames plan, with clearer credit wording ([f2358315e](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f2358315e59731833334c5d881a7fb5543c22a97), [#6833](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6833)).\n- **Core:** Playback health reports how long a video on screen showed no moving picture ([359b6c8a3](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/359b6c8a3877039068711915d94323f7e777f5e6), [#6856](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6856)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Lint:** The podcast-lanes.html page Desktop writes is not a second root composition ([5169422a8](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/5169422a8a424fadbb97424a95316a63343eb4f2), [#6809](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6809)).\n- **Player:** Preview voice no longer goes silent while other tracks play ([443ded426](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/443ded42615f81fd5a4b97d34318676fb76957bd), [#6859](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6859)).\n- **History:** Reading a project's history no longer rewrites its record ([e342a9099](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e342a9099162b6a5d4ad89d9a986203c2b548091), [#6832](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6832)).\n- **Lint:** A timeline registered in a local script file counts as registered ([0708f6ca7](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/0708f6ca7dc0718487a2d0a066853b87db92a1aa), [#6829](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6829)).\n- **CLI:** Say stdin was empty when a JSON flag reads - and nothing is piped ([ef9155fee](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/ef9155fee13cf8a65282e1681ac2761edcb1fcc2), [#6852](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6852)).\n- **Core:** Same-time sets at 0 land in authored order on the first frame ([aafbd96b7](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/aafbd96b77702f295c77de1430dfcb14302e4958), [#6851](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6851)).\n- **CLI:** Remove-background gathers each decoded frame in linear time ([80f9350da](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/80f9350da21b54741d392c684511b6f93a00026c), [#6850](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6850)).\n- **CLI:** Exit-time telemetry no longer loses a render's events on Windows ([6aa9c78bd](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/6aa9c78bd87d6215ad7c599e4caf44331b39a645), [#6847](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6847)).\n- **CLI:** Read BOM-prefixed JSON files for timeline plans, grades and motion specs ([16e2e4c6b](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/16e2e4c6b5579a0ccefbfc7bd6991ec23a6f8c75), [#6845](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6845)).\n- **Producer:** HDR renders report their encoder wait in render telemetry ([3d942ee92](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3d942ee9210a166a53a6497b76aa323acc8e95bc), [#6841](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6841)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Studio:** A long timeline no longer lays itself out on every render while it settles ([9b0df610c](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/9b0df610cca45bb1bc8bacec78059d3c4443ec09), [#6855](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6855)).\n\n## Catalog\n\n- One Docs menu and Catalog in the top bar ([4cee7be83](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4cee7be834c18b571da1cfcda6e3eaeca7689855), [#6860](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6860)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.222...v0.8.223\n"
}
